---
// Multilingual Welcome Section
---

<section
    class="w-full relative overflow-hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center text-center"
>
    <iframe
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full z-0"
        width="100%"
        height="100%"
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/E2NzAyXjExc?si=3B86aZivOYxjlzEM&controls=0&autoplay=1&mute=0"
        title="YouTube video player"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="mb-6">
            <p
                class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"
            >
                Selamat Datang / أهلا وسهلا / 어서 오십시오 / いらっしゃいませ / 欢迎
            </p>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">
                Welcome to SMP ABBS Surakarta
            </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/90 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Sebuah institusi pendidikan yang berdedikasi untuk membentuk
            generasi cemerlang dengan nilai-nilai Islam modern dan kualitas
            internasional
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
